      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "13",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yehoahasi omorwoti bw’Abaisraeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase omwaka bw’emerongo ebere n’etato bw’okogaamba kwa Yoashi, mosinto bw’Ahasia, omorwoti bw’Abayuda, Yehoahasi, mosinto o Yehu, agachaaka kogaambera Abaisraeli agwo Samaria, na akagaamba emiaka ikomi na etano na ebere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ere agakora ayare amabe ase obosio bw’Omonene; akabwatia chingencho chia Yeroboamu, mosinto o Nebati, ase ogokora ebibe biria ere akorete akagera Abaisraeli bagakora ebibe; teatananete korwa ase birobio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene akaba nendamwamu enene ase Abaisraeli, na ekero ase ekero akaba okobabeeka ase okoboko kwa Hasaeli, omorwoti bw’Abasiiria, na ase okwa Beni‐Hadadi, mosinto o Hasaeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Yehoahasi agasaba Omonene, n’Omonene akamoigwa, ekiagera aroche ogochandwa kw’Abaisraeli, buna omorwoti bw’Abasiiria abachandete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio Omonene akaa Abaisraeli omotooria, obatooretie korwa ase amaboko ’Abasiiria. Magega y’ayio Abaisraeli bakagenderera komenya ase chinka chiabo buna agwo ritang’ani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende nonya naboigo, tibeatananete korwa ase ebibe bi’enyomba ya Yeroboamu, biria ere akorete akagera Abaisraeli bagakora ebibe, korende bakaba bakogenderera kobikora. Boigo omote bw’Asera, enyasae eria enkuungu, ogatigara agwo Samaria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoahasi tatigareretigwe abasikari otatiga abariini chibarasi emerongo etano, ne chigari ikomi, na abanto baarenge gotaara namagoro chilifu ikomi, ekiagera omorwoti bw’Abasiiria aitete abanto bonsi bakaba buna orotu rw’ekeooreri rogotiringwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono amang’ana ande onsi igoro ya Yehoahasi, na aya onsi akorete, na okobua kwaye, nigo ariikire ase Egetabu ki’ogokora kw’Abarwoti b’Abaisraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoahasi akaraara ase chisokoro chiaye chiararete, agatindekwa agwo Samaria, na Yehoasi, omwana oye omomura, akaba okogaamba ase ribaga riaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yehoasi omorwoti bw’Abaisraeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase omwaka bw’emerongo etato, na gatano na kabere, bw’okogaamba kwa Yoashi, omorwoti bw’Abayuda, Yehoasi, mosinto o Yehoahasi, agachaaka kogaambera Abaisraeli agwo Samaria, na akagaamba emiaka ikomi na etano nomo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nere agakora amabe ase obosio bw’Omonene, teatananete korwa ase ekemo ki’ebibe biria Yeroboamu, mosinto o Nebati, akorete akagera Abaisraeli bagakora ebibe, korende akagenderera kobikora.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono amang’ana ande onsi igoro ya Yehoasi, na aya onsi akorete, na okobua kwaye gw’okorwania Amasia, omorwoti bw’Abayuda, nigo ariikire ase Egetabu ki’ogokora kw’Abarwoti b’Abaisraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoasi akaraara ase chisokoro chiaye chiararete, agatindekwa agwo Samaria aase abarwoti b’Abaisraeli batindegetwe. Yeroboamu agaikaransa ase ekerogo ki’oborwoti kia Yehoasi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ogokwa kw’Elisha",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Elisha arenge noborwaire bw’amakweri Yehoasi, omorwoti bw’Abaisraeli, akagenda komoorora. Gaikireo agachaaka korera, “Tata ominto! Tata ominto! Aye nigo ore ase Abaisraeli buna chigari na abariini chibarasi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elisha akamoteebia: “Imokia obota na emegwe!” Ase ayio akaimokia ebinto ebio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende akamoteebia: “Ng’usa obota bwao!” Nere akabong’usa. Na Elisha akabeeka amaboko aye ase amaboko ’omorwoti oria,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akamoteebia, “Igora ekebao kerochie moocha!” Yehoasi agakeigora. Erio Elisha akamoteebia, “Rasa!” Nere akarasa. Elisha agakwana, “Omogwe bw’obobui Omonene. Omogwe bw’obobui igoro y’Abasiiria. Aye norwanie Abasiiria agwo Afeki goika obasirie kegima.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Elisha agateebia omorwoti bw’Abaisraeli: “Imokia emegwe!” Nere akayeimokia. Naende akamoteebia: “Rasa inse ase riroba!” Nere akarasa inse ase riroba ara gatato, agatiga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonto oria o Nyasae akaba nendamwamu asare, akamoteebia, “Nigo yagwenerete orase inse ara gatano, gose ara gatano na rimo; kware gokora igo nanga nigo kwabua Abasiiria na kobasiria kegima, korende bono nigo orabaake ara gatato rioka”.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Elisha agakwa, agatindekwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bono ebiombe bi’Abamoabu bikaba bigocha ase ense eria ase omochakano bwa kera omwaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekaba ekero omonto oyomo akwete arenge gotindekwa, ekeombe ekemo kia biria kegacha, na abanto babogoretie omobere oria, bakayoruta ase oboina bw’Elisha. Ekero ogweteo ogakuna amauga ’Elisha, okaboka na koba moyo, agatenena namagoro aye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Esegi egati y’Abaisraeli na Abasiiria",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hasaeli, omorwoti bw’Abasiiria, akaba ogochanda Abaisraeli ase amatuko onsi ay’okogaamba kwa Yehoahasi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende Omonene nigo arenge nobwanchani ase bare, na abarorerete amaabera, akabairanera ase engencho y’okobwatana kw’ogotianania akorete na Aburaamu, na Isaka, na Yakobo, na igo tabasiretie. Tabatugutete korwa ase obosio bwaye nonya ngoika reero iga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Hasaeli, omorwoti bw’Abasiiria, akwete, Beni‐Hadadi, omwana oye omomura, akaba okogaamba ase ribaga riaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Yehoasi, mosinto o Yehoahasi, akaira naende korwa ase Beni‐Hadadi, mosinto o Hasaeli, emechie eyio ere konya airire korwa ase Yehoahasi ise ekero gi’esegi. Yehoasi akabua Beni‐Hadadi ara gatato, akairania emechie y’Abaisraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
